"     │ ctrl-u/ctrl-d scroll by half a page                                │     "
"     │ g/G           to the top and the bottom, also home/end             │     "
"     │ o             open an image in the system viewer                   │     "
"     │ z/tab/esc/q   leave the full screen                                │     "
